    "norm": "Tests {@link InternationalFixedDate#until(java.time.temporal.ChronoLocalDate)}. <p> The {@code until} method returns the {@link ChronoPeriod} (years, months, days) between two International Fixed dates. Each test case supplies a start date and an end date, together with the year/month/day components of the period that {@code start.until(end)} is expected to produce."
